# ============================================================
#  Build artifacts
# ============================================================
/build/
/out/
/out-verify/
/cmake-build-*/
*.obj
*.o
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.lib
*.dll
*.exp
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake
compile_commands.json

# ============================================================
#  vcpkg (manifest mode — 설치본은 로컬 캐시)
# ============================================================
/vcpkg_installed/
**/vcpkg_installed/

# ============================================================
#  Generated protobuf sources
# ============================================================
*.pb.cc
*.pb.h

# ============================================================
#  IDE / editor
# ============================================================
/.vs/
*.user
.idea/
*.swp

# ============================================================
#  .claude — 공유 자산(agents/commands/skills/hooks/settings.json)은
#  계속 추적. 로컬 캐시성 파일만 무시.
# ============================================================
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/**/*.local.json
**/compiler-file-hash-cache.json
.claude/projects/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/todos/
.claude/statsig/
.claude/.credentials.json

# ============================================================
#  Logs / runtime
# ============================================================
/logs/
*.log

# ============================================================
#  Markdown — 일단 전부 커밋 제외.
#  나중에 필요한 것만 이 줄 "아래에"  !경로.md  로 화이트리스트 추가.
#  예)  !/README.md
#       !/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
# ============================================================
*.md

# ============================================================
#  개인정보 / 비공개 — 절대 커밋 금지
#  (면접 준비, 이력서, 서류 등)  →  /private/ 폴더에 두거나 아래 패턴 사용
# ============================================================
/private/
/personal/
*.private.md
INTERVIEW_PREP.md
*면접*.md
*이력서*.md
*자기소개*.md
*서류*.md
*포트폴리오*.md
resume*.md
cv*.md
cover-letter*.md
